==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{term|vána|lang=non}}, from the noun {{term|ván||hope|lang=non}} (Icelandic {{term|von|lang=is}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈvɔːna/|lang=is}}
*: {{rhymes|ɔːna|lang=is}}

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|vonaði|vonað}}

# to [[hope]]
#: ''Við skulum '''vona''' það besta.''
#:: Let's '''hope''' for the best.

